{
  "profile": "full",
  "tool": {
    "name": "eplan_placement_create",
    "title": "Create text and graphics on an EPLAN page",
    "description": "Creates text/line/rectangle on a Circuit page; mm, bottom left, y up. One undo; approval outside scratch. Text needs the project display language or ??_??; ??_?? cannot be mixed with languages (A54). Example: {\"project\":\"P\",\"page\":\"1\",\"items\":[{\"kind\":\"line\",\"points\":[[1,1],[2,2]]}]}.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "project",
        "page",
        "items"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "project": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "page": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "items": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 50,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "kind"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "kind": {
                "enum": [
                  "text",
                  "line",
                  "rectangle"
                ]
              },
              "position": {
                "type": "array"
              },
              "points": {
                "type": "array"
              },
              "corners": {
                "type": "array"
              },
              "contents": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "height_mm": {
                "type": "number"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "snap_to_grid": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true
        },
        "dry_run": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false
        },
        "show_page": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "description": "Open or focus this page in the EPLAN editor before drawing so the user can watch; UI only, no data change."
        },
        "response_format": {
          "enum": [
            "concise",
            "detailed"
          ],
          "default": "concise"
        }
      }
    },
    "outputSchema": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "project",
        "page",
        "execution",
        "dryRun",
        "gridSize",
        "boundarySource",
        "items",
        "changes",
        "connectionChanges"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "project": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "page": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "execution": {
          "enum": [
            "not_started",
            "committed"
          ]
        },
        "dryRun": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "gridSize": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "boundarySource": {
          "enum": [
            "Page.Size",
            "unverified"
          ]
        },
        "items": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 50,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "requested",
              "actual",
              "bounds",
              "snapped"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "requested": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/item"
              },
              "actual": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/item"
              },
              "bounds": {
                "type": [
                  "array",
                  "null"
                ],
                "minItems": 4,
                "maxItems": 4,
                "items": {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              },
              "snapped": {
                "type": "boolean"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "changes": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 50,
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "connectionChanges": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 0
        },
        "pageShown": {
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "hint": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "warning": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "recovered": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "$defs": {
        "point": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 2,
          "maxItems": 2,
          "items": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 10000
          }
        },
        "pair": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 2,
          "maxItems": 2,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/point"
          }
        },
        "item": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": [
                "kind",
                "position",
                "contents",
                "height_mm"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "kind": {
                  "const": "text"
                },
                "position": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/point"
                },
                "height_mm": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "minimum": 0.5,
                  "maximum": 100
                },
                "contents": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "minProperties": 1,
                  "propertyNames": {
                    "minLength": 5,
                    "maxLength": 5,
                    "pattern": "^([a-z]{2}_[A-Z]{2}|\\?\\?_\\?\\?)$"
                  },
                  "additionalProperties": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 500
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": [
                "kind",
                "points"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "kind": {
                  "const": "line"
                },
                "points": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/pair"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": [
                "kind",
                "corners"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "kind": {
                  "const": "rectangle"
                },
                "corners": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/pair"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "annotations": {
      "destructiveHint": false,
      "idempotentHint": false,
      "openWorldHint": false,
      "readOnlyHint": false
    }
  },
  "usage": "## Examples\n```json\n{\"project\":\"Line1\",\"page\":\"P\",\"items\":[{\"kind\":\"text\",\"position\":[10,20],\"contents\":{\"??_??\":\"Panel\"},\"height_mm\":3},{\"kind\":\"line\",\"points\":[[10,10],[30,10]]},{\"kind\":\"rectangle\",\"corners\":[[5,5],[40,30]]}]}\n```\n## Workflow\nFull profile. Execution creates the complete batch atomically, reads every item back and supports one-step undo; outside scratch needs approval. Never repeat a committed or unknown call. A failed batch rolls back everything without an undo step.\n## Fields\nOne Circuit page, 1-50 items; coordinates in mm, bottom-left origin, y up, 0-10000. snap_to_grid defaults true; the preview reports requested and actual geometry plus full bounds. Text height is 0.5-100 mm, at most 500 characters across explicit languages. Never mix ??_?? with languages. Supply ??_?? or at least the project display language: other text is invisible (A54). Lines are graphics. No connection generation. concise/detailed budgets are 5k/20k, with complete impact lists.\n## Errors\nINVALID_ARGUMENT reports JSON Pointer violations for schema, languages or full-outline bounds. CAPABILITY_MISSING reports missing reliable page geometry, display language, or text outline. Preflight failures and previews report execution=not_started; failed writes report rolled_back or unknown. Execution reports boundarySource=unverified and bounds=null: coordinates and grid are checked, but page containment is not proven. Use reliable text measurements; plot-frame size and character-count estimates are not fallbacks.\n"
}
